The public domain dedication above covers this project's own source. It cannot
extend to third-party material, which keeps its original licence:

  Font data under main/ui/fonts/ is generated from typefaces distributed with
  the LVGL component:

    Montserrat (Julieta Ulanovsky and contributors)
      SIL Open Font License 1.1 — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat

    Font Awesome Free 5 (Fonticons, Inc.)
      Font data: SIL Open Font License 1.1
      Icon designs: CC BY 4.0 — https://fontawesome.com/license/free

  Both permit embedding and redistribution, including commercially, and neither
  requires that this project adopt their licence.

  Build-time dependencies (ESP-IDF, LVGL, esp_lvgl_port, esp_lcd_touch_gt911)
  are fetched during the build rather than vendored, and carry their own
  licences.
